                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7aba2b6c-b868-384d-9379-24beaffb3343",
                        "entry_id": "247fda33-d9de-31cd-8c39-35bcb00143df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Espèce de filet utilisé pour la pêche au poisson, formé de trois réseaux appliqués l’un sur l’autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f568f16-c1e2-44d8-bb7b-13680ab2de13",
                                "sense_id": "7aba2b6c-b868-384d-9379-24beaffb3343",
                                "text": "Comme bâtiments d'exploitation, par exemple, il n'y avait qu'une étable, une grange et un petit hangar pour les outils où l'on suspendait aussi les filets de pêche, tramails et verveux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98366f9c-f8d9-404d-806a-98708a27e9e5",
                                "sense_id": "7aba2b6c-b868-384d-9379-24beaffb3343",
                                "text": "Ainsi, entre deux tramails, pour effrayer le poisson et l'envoyer aux filets se faire prendre par les ouïes, chahutions-nous le bief."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96e871f5-b69d-4325-a7b0-b90c69434622",
                                "sense_id": "7aba2b6c-b868-384d-9379-24beaffb3343",
                                "text": "Plusieurs filets de type Araignée ou de type Tramail."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f03afd88-e391-3bc3-8d94-c6d476d37175",
                        "entry_id": "247fda33-d9de-31cd-8c39-35bcb00143df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Filet composé de trois rangs de mailles, propre à la chasse des oiseaux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "170739ee-8ed1-4923-bf4a-b6cb1954ca10",
                        "source_entry_id": "247fda33-d9de-31cd-8c39-35bcb00143df",
                        "target_lang_word": "trammel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trammel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68cf6401-f679-3d6b-8a72-5866c8afa5f9",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Whatever impedes activity, progress, or freedom, such as a net or shackle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6236982-6d00-477d-b7cc-dd5c00f3f68f",
                                                "sense_id": "68cf6401-f679-3d6b-8a72-5866c8afa5f9",
                                                "text": "[They] disclaim the trammels of any sordid contract."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ee4e1b2-9ba1-40e5-8aad-7c460937c39a",
                                                "sense_id": "68cf6401-f679-3d6b-8a72-5866c8afa5f9",
                                                "text": "The men who came here were able to throw off all the trammels of tradition and established doctrine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44ebb677-7eda-3abf-a862-7d96eb5f75a8",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fishing net that has large mesh at the edges and smaller mesh in the middle"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46f56a25-a130-314c-ac6b-e05837dc9c59",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of net for catching birds, fishes, or other prey."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2db62318-cd81-499b-a3f5-e9b6a03a38ca",
                                                "sense_id": "46f56a25-a130-314c-ac6b-e05837dc9c59",
                                                "text": "1633,\nThe tuck carrieth a like fashion , save that it is narrower meshed , and ( therefore scarce lawful ) with a long bunt in the midst : the trammel differeth not much from the shape of this bunt, and serveth to such use as the wear and haking."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc07eb23-24b8-37a8-9559-db42a11f7786",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vertical bar with several notches or chain of rings suspended over a fire, used to hang cooking pots by a hook which has an easily adjustable height."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e74e54fc-ea14-373c-8065-8c088485d8ee",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Braids or plaits of hair."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81eba4cb-690b-4872-9c52-c4e79a785cdc",
                                                "sense_id": "e74e54fc-ea14-373c-8065-8c088485d8ee",
                                                "text": "Her golden lockes she roundly did uptye\nIn breaded tramels, that no looser heares\nDid out of order stray about her daintie eares."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5faece7-0551-3495-a71e-4f75d557f47e",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of shackle used for regulating the motions of a horse and making it amble."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "365968cb-0c93-3328-afa7-48b75a8e44d9",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instrument for drawing ellipses, one part of which consists of a cross with two grooves at right angles to each other, the other being a beam carrying two pins (which slide in those grooves), and also the describing pencil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8e3dfba-4e96-355a-a290-769c270a9f43",
                                        "entry_id": "33178b81-8c88-3b4e-aa88-c855682aa4ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A beam compass."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trammel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b23c2a4-0544-3603-b675-e35e1e63e2a2",
                                        "entry_id": "fa7764ce-6582-3d53-8ccd-bb7f1671f866",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To entangle, as in a net."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e3d61ca-82c4-462b-92e4-b4acedef47bf",
                                                "sense_id": "7b23c2a4-0544-3603-b675-e35e1e63e2a2",
                                                "text": "the scarce-snatched hours\nWhich deepening pain left to his lordliest powers: —\nHeaven lost through spider-trammelled prison-bars."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2fe536a-75ff-38e6-b79b-0d73cc77649a",
                                        "entry_id": "fa7764ce-6582-3d53-8ccd-bb7f1671f866",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To confine; to hamper; to shackle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3edd802-7196-4216-b544-62ec87bd282d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2fe536a-75ff-38e6-b79b-0d73cc77649a",
                                                "text": "In their vote, you would get something of some value, at least, however small; but in the other case, only the trammelled judgment of an individual, of no significance, be it which way it might."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0e030b2-dcce-42f4-aaba-43524167be8f",
                                                "sense_id": "a2fe536a-75ff-38e6-b79b-0d73cc77649a",
                                                "text": "Virtuous motives, trammeled by inertia and timidity, are no match for armed and resolute wickedness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
